OL,3,AAlgeria president seeks death penalty
OL,4,Afor arsonists after deadly forest fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlgerian President Abdelmadjid Tebboune
OL,7,Fhas said he wants to reinstate the
OL,8,Fdeath penalty for arsonists, following
OL,9,Fa wave of forest fires that have killed
OL,10,Fat least 12 people.
OL,12,FThe president ordered the justice
OL,13,Fministry to introduce changes to the
OL,14,Fcriminal law introducing capital
OL,15,Fpunishment for arsonists. Capital
OL,16,Fpunishment remains in the country's
OL,17,Fpenal code for some offences, but no
OL,18,Fexecution has been carried out since
OL,19,F1993.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
