OL,3,AAlgeria president seeks death penalty
OL,4,Afor arsonists after deadly forest fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 wildfires have been
OL,7,Frecorded in recent days in the
OL,8,Fnorth-east of the country, most of
OL,9,Fwhich have been extinguished.
OL,11,FOn Saturday, Tebboune said he did not
OL,12,Frule out foul play.
